@page
@model HydroSentinel.Pages.PricingModel
@using HydroSentinel.Services
@inject PlanCatalog Catalog
@{ ViewData["Title"] = "HydroSentinel Pricing"; }

<div class="page-redesign pricing-page">
    <section class="rd-section rd-hero" aria-labelledby="pricing-title"><div class="shell rd-hero-grid"><div><p class="rd-kicker">Flyer-supplied starting figures</p><h1 id="pricing-title">Simple, transparent pricing.</h1><p class="rd-hero-lede">Review the current Firmlon flyer figures for HydroSentinel. Final commercial terms, eligibility, taxes, and payment remain subject to confirmation.</p><a class="button button-primary" href="#plans">Compare plans <span aria-hidden="true">↓</span></a></div><div class="rd-editorial-aside"><p class="rd-kicker">Pricing principles</p><h2>Clear decisions start with clear terms.</h2><p>One-time setup and recurring subscription fees are shown separately. The backend must supply authoritative totals before checkout.</p><div class="rd-note">@PlanCatalog.OfferNote</div></div></div></section>
    <section id="plans" class="rd-section rd-section-soft" aria-labelledby="plans-title"><div class="shell"><div class="rd-section-head"><div><p class="rd-kicker">Plan framework</p><h2 id="plans-title">Choose the conversation that fits.</h2></div><p>These figures are transcribed from <code>@PlanCatalog.Source</code>. Contact Firmlon for approved commercial terms before purchase.</p></div><div class="rd-note pricing-source-note" role="note"><strong>Flyer-supplied pricing:</strong> @PlanCatalog.OfferNote</div><div class="rd-price-grid">@foreach (var plan in Catalog.Plans) { <article class="rd-price-card @(plan.Id == "pro" ? "featured" : "")"><p class="rd-kicker">@(plan.Id == "pro" ? "Review with Firmlon" : "Flyer figure")</p><h3>@plan.Name</h3><p>@plan.Description</p><div class="rd-price"><strong>₦@plan.HardwarePrice.ToString("N0")</strong><small>one-time hardware · + ₦@plan.MonthlyPrice.ToString("N0")/month · @plan.DeviceAllowance</small></div><ul><li>@plan.DeviceAllowance</li><li>Final scope and eligibility to be confirmed</li><li>Payment uses trusted backend pricing only</li></ul><a class="button @(plan.Id == "pro" ? "button-primary" : "button-outline")" asp-page="/Contact">Enquire about @plan.Name</a></article> }</div></div></section>
    <section class="rd-section" aria-labelledby="compare-title"><div class="shell"><div class="rd-section-head"><div><p class="rd-kicker">Side by side</p><h2 id="compare-title">Compare the flyer-supplied figures.</h2></div><p>Prices and unit allowances require confirmation before purchase.</p></div><div class="rd-table-wrap"><table class="rd-table"><caption class="sr-only">HydroSentinel plan comparison</caption><thead><tr><th scope="col">Plan detail</th>@foreach (var plan in Catalog.Plans) { <th scope="col">@plan.Name</th> }</tr></thead><tbody><tr><th scope="row">One-time hardware price</th>@foreach (var plan in Catalog.Plans) { <td>₦@plan.HardwarePrice.ToString("N0")</td> }</tr><tr><th scope="row">Recurring plan fee</th>@foreach (var plan in Catalog.Plans) { <td>₦@plan.MonthlyPrice.ToString("N0")/month</td> }</tr><tr><th scope="row">Device allowance</th>@foreach (var plan in Catalog.Plans) { <td>@plan.DeviceAllowance</td> }</tr><tr><th scope="row">Commercial status</th>@foreach (var plan in Catalog.Plans) { <td>Confirmation required</td> }</tr></tbody></table></div></div></section>
    <section class="rd-section rd-section-soft" aria-labelledby="faq-title"><div class="shell rd-editorial"><div><p class="rd-kicker">Before you choose</p><h2 id="faq-title">Questions worth resolving.</h2><p>These answers identify what still needs approval.</p></div><div class="rd-faq"><details><summary>Are these the confirmed prices?</summary><p>They are the figures shown in the supplied Firmlon flyer. Please confirm current prices, taxes, availability, and eligibility with Firmlon before purchase.</p></details><details><summary>Is the hardware cost included?</summary><p>The flyer presents a one-time hardware figure for each plan. Final inclusions and hardware terms require confirmation.</p></details><details><summary>Are there recurring subscription fees?</summary><p>The flyer shows monthly amounts. Billing, renewal, cancellation, and subscription terms require confirmation.</p></details></div></div></section>
    <section class="rd-section-dark"><div class="shell rd-cta-row"><div><p class="rd-kicker">Tailored guidance</p><h2>Need a solution for your installation?</h2></div><a class="button button-light" asp-page="/Contact">Contact Firmlon <span aria-hidden="true">→</span></a></div></section>
</div>
